    "sentence_translations": [
      "Go Freshen Up",
      "",
      "Little Le's boyfriend Paul is a foreigner. He loves studying Chinese.",
      "",
      "One day, Little Le and Paul treated a friend to a meal.",
      "After the meal, the friend said: “I'm just gonna go freshen up.”",
      "",
      "Paul asked Little Le: “What does ‘freshen up’ mean?”",
      "",
      "Little Le said: “‘Freshen up’ means going to the toilet.”",
      "",
      "Paul memorized it.",
      "",
      "After eating, the friend said: “Paul, next time you're available, I'll treat you guys to a meal.”",
      "",
      "Paul angrily said: “I never eat when I'm in the bathroom.”"
